# Loss detection must only fail a live record; applied to a finished one it rewrites the outcome.
MODULE: TerminalIsFinalStallRewritesFinished
TARGET: TerminalIsFinal
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: a lapsed heartbeat lease is applied to a record already finished
PERTURBS: LeaseExpire

--- FIND
    /\ Live(o) /\ alive[opRunner[o]] /\ stalls < MaxStalls
--- REPLACE
    /\ opState[o] # "Absent" /\ alive[opRunner[o]] /\ stalls < MaxStalls
--- END
